# Re-enable normal browser caching for the vendored third-party bundles,
# overriding web/.htaccess's blanket `no-store` on *.js / *.css.
#
# That parent rule exists because this app has no build step and no
# versioned filenames, so an edited source file could silently keep
# serving its pre-edit body (see web/.htaccess's own comment). Nothing in
# THIS folder is ever hand-edited between sessions — it is a pinned
# vendor drop — so the rule bought nothing here and cost a full
# re-download + re-parse of maplibre-gl.js (~803 KB) and
# maplibre-gl.css (~64 KB) on every page load AND every in-app
# navigation, which is a large part of why the live map felt slow to
# appear. Bump the version in web/index.html's <script src> (or just
# clear the browser cache) if this folder is ever re-vendored.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  <FilesMatch "\.(js|css)$">
    Header set Cache-Control "public, max-age=604800"
  </FilesMatch>
</IfModule>
